Scenario: View Recent Blog Entry Index Via Select Locale
	End users should be able to view recent blogs on the blogs page when the Locale is updated.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "blog"
	And I accept all cookies
	And I change the locale to "Australia"
	Then I should be able to view the blog entry with the title "4 Ways to Embrace a Culture of Learning" in the blog index
	When I go to the www page with the url "blog"
	And I change the locale to "Finland"
	Then I should be able to view the blog entry with the title "B2B-verkkokaupan edut ja haasteet" in the blog index

Scenario: View Recent Blog Entry Index Via Search
	End users should be able to view recent blogs on the blogs page using search keywords.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "blog"
	And I accept all cookies
	And I search for blog entries using the keyword "Turn your B2B"
	Then I should be able to view the blog entry with the title "Turn Your B2B Portal into a Competitive Advantage" in the blog index
	When I go to the www page with the url "blog"
	And I search for blog entries using the keyword "15 Awesome"
	Then I should be able to view the blog entry with the title "15 Awesome Customer Portal Examples" in the blog index